backups/

# The whole schema in one file. GENERATED from supabase/migrations by
# `npm run sql:build`, which CI runs on every job, so the file is always
# present and always current -- it just is not stored here. Tracked, it was
# touched by every PR that added a migration and so collided with every other
# such PR: four were stopped by it in two days (2026-10-30/31), none over a
# real disagreement. Nothing is lost: run `npm run sql:build` after a clone.
/supabase/RUN_THIS_IN_SUPABASE.sql

# Output of the weekly local import (scripts/weekly-blocked-chains.ps1). Re-creatable.
logs/
